h group is)\nwithin_asd = Z_asd.var(axis=0).mean()\nwithin_td  = Z_td.var(axis=0).mean()\n\nprint(f\"  L2 distance between ASD and TD means : {group_distance:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"  Within-ASD variance                  : {within_asd:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"  Within-TD  variance                  : {within_td:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"  Signal-to-noise ratio (dist/within)  : \"\n      f\"{group_distance / (within_asd + within_td + 1e-8):.4f}\")\n\nif group_distance < 0.01:\n    print(\"  ► NO SEPARATION: ASD and TD overlap completely in latent space\")\nelif group_distance < 0.1:\n    print(\"  ► WEAK SEPARATION: some signal but classifier will struggle\")\nelse:\n    print(\"  ► CLEAR SEPARATION: latent space encodes diagnostic difference\")\n\n# ── Check 3: Gradient flow to encoder ────────────────────────\n# We run one forward+backward pass with classification loss only\n# and check whether the encoder's weights actually received gradients.\n# Zero gradients → classification loss is not reaching the encoder.\n\nprint(\"\\nCheck 3: Gradient flow from classification loss to encoder\")\nprint(\"-\" * 45)\n\n# Use first training subject\nadj_seq_0 = train_subject_graphs[0]\nlabel_0   = train_subject_labels[0]\n\nenc_temp        = GraphEncoder(latent_dim=ABIDE_LATENT_DIM, in_channels=1).to(DEVICE)\nclassifier_temp = nn.Sequential(\n    nn.Linear(ABIDE_LATENT_DIM, 16),\n    nn.ReLU(),\n    nn.Linear(16, 2)\n).to(DEVICE)\nce_loss_fn = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\n\nenc_temp.train(); classifier_temp.train()\n\nz_list = []\nfor t in range(adj_seq_0.shape[0]):\n    edge_index = torch.from_numpy(\n        np.array(np.where(adj_seq_0[t] > 0))\n    ).long().to(DEVICE)\n\n    z_t = enc_temp(edge_index, num_nodes=ABIDE_N_NODES) \\\n          if edge_index.numel() > 0 \\\n          else torch.zeros(1, ABIDE_LATENT_DIM, device=DEVICE)\n    z_list.append(z_t)\n\nz_mean       = torch.cat(z_list, dim=0).mean(dim=0, keepdim=True)\nlabel_tensor = torch.tensor([label_0], dtype=torch.long, device=DEVICE)\nlogits